# Per-Dockerfile ignore for rules/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads it instead of
# the shared .dockerignore for `docker build -f rules/Dockerfile`). The image
# builds ./rules/cmd/rules-server, which needs the rules module and
# pkg/scanner from the root module; everything else in the repository stays
# out of the context.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!pkg
!rules
rules/*.db
rules/*.db-*
rules/rules-server
rules/Dockerfile
rules/Dockerfile.dockerignore
